# docs/prompts-history/ holds archived prompt-session logs written by
# scripts/prompt-history.mjs. Links inside them (repo-relative paths like
# docs/deploy-ovh.md, and stack traces with absolute Windows paths) were
# valid in the original session context at the repo root; resolved from the
# archive directory they point nowhere. Rewriting historical archives would
# falsify them, so lychee skips any URL under this directory.
docs/prompts-history/

# Prompt-history archives also quote stack traces with absolute Windows
# paths (file:///D:/...) from the dev machine; those can never resolve in CI.
file:///[A-Za-z]:/

# fda.gov abuse-detection intermittently 302-redirects bots to an apology
# page, which lychee reports as 404 (observed 2026-09-27 on the PR run; the
# same links passed on run 36190087927 and work in a browser). Sources cited
# in docs/research.md.
https://www\.fda\.gov/

# beautylish.com returns 403 to non-browser user agents; the cited thread
# returns 200 with a browser UA (verified 2026-09-27). Source cited in
# docs/research.md.
https://www\.beautylish\.com/

# 2026-10-04: patrickta.com rate-limits CI traffic with 429 Too Many
# Requests (observed on the ux-pass/g1 PR run; main's link-check passed on
# 2026-09-27 and the article loads in a browser). Source cited in
# docs/research.md.
https://patrickta\.com/

# 2026-10-04: colorescience.com rate-limits CI traffic with 429 Too Many
# Requests (same run as patrickta.com above; loads fine in a browser).
# Source cited in docs/research.md.
https://www\.colorescience\.com/

# 2026-10-04: ibacosmetics.com rate-limits CI traffic with 429 Too Many
# Requests (observed on run 37194850932; returns 200 from non-CI IPs and
# loads fine in a browser). Source cited in docs/research.md.
https://ibacosmetics\.com/

# 2026-10-04: typsybeauty.com rate-limits CI traffic with 429 Too Many
# Requests (same run as ibacosmetics.com above; loads fine in a browser).
# Source cited in docs/research.md.
https://typsybeauty\.com/
